{"seconds": 162.3, "exit": 0, "final": "Perfect! **Bxg4+** wins the knight (+3 material) and gives check. The bishop is hanging to the queen, but after Black's best try **Qxg4+**, I've still won a piece.\n\n## Coaching Note\n\nBlack's knight on g4 is undefended. **Bxg4+** wins it outright with check! After **Qxg4+ Kh1**, you've won a piece. Black gets counterplay (e2+, etc.), but material advantage usually wins at club level. Key lesson: always look for undefended pieces, especially ones giving check when captured\u2014that's the most forcing win.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Bxg4+\", \"line\": [\"Bxg4+\", \"Qxg4+\", \"Kh1\", \"e2\", \"Rxf7\", \"Qe4+\"], \"motifs\": [\"hangingPiece\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21", "move": "Qd1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21", "move": "Qc1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21", "move": "Rc2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21", "move": "Rb8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21", "move": "Qa8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21", "move": "Qe1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21", "move": "Rb4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21", "mo